  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICHR mission statement : in its capacity as a Palestinian natinal and constitutional human rights institution , the ICHR seeks to protect and promote human rights in accordance with the Palestinian Basic Law, national legislaion, Declaration of Independence and international human ritghts standards. Based on a human rights-based approach, the ICHR monitors and documents human rights violations with a view to creating a democratic and tolerant society.</narrative>
  </description>
